                        <Border Style="{StaticResource ContentSurface}" Margin="0,0,0,12"><StackPanel><TextBlock Text="诊断画面保留" FontWeight="SemiBold" Margin="0,0,0,6"/><TextBlock Text="最近最多 5 次采集会话 · 总预算 2 GB" Foreground="#D9BC7B"/><TextBlock Text="仅清理诊断画面缓存；原始对局、人工校对、段位走势和牌库独立保留。" TextWrapping="Wrap" FontSize="12" Foreground="#B9BEC5" Margin="0,6,0,0"/></StackPanel></Border><loc:LocalizedTextBlock Text="Training recording frame rate" FontWeight="SemiBold" FontSize="12"/>
                        <ComboBox x:Name="RecordingFrameRateChoice" SelectedIndex="1" SelectionChanged="RecordingFrameRate_OnChanged"
